+/*Just Smaller: segmented filter choice.
+Filters are chosen per scanline and deflate looks back only 32 KiB, so the
+filters of different heuristics can be combined section by section. Each
+section takes the filters of the heuristic whose rows deflate smallest after
+the rows already chosen; zlib judges, Zopfli compresses the result once.*/
